{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "circle.foxwq",
  "version": 2,
  "name": "弈友圈",
  "summary": "分析野狐账号的弈友圈：Workflow 从通用 fetch_batch 开始，组合 URL、游标分页、集合处理与围棋关系算子，抓取主账号及高频对手棋谱，最后生成可复算的关系摘要。",
  "routeHint": [
    "分析某野狐账号的弈友圈",
    "看看这个野狐号最近都跟谁下棋",
    "找出野狐上经常互相交战的账号群体"
  ],
  "category": "围棋",
  "primitives": [],
  "prompt": "用户想分析某个野狐账号的弈友圈、看它最近都跟谁下棋，或找出经常互相交战的账号群体时使用本技能。\\n先确认野狐昵称；昵称缺失时只追问昵称，不假定账号。\\n\\n本技能由宿主 Workflow 执行完整采集与计算链：通用 fetch_batch 负责公开 GET；url、collection、pagination 插件负责 URL 参数、数组组合与游标分页；circle 插件负责围棋对手筛选和关系图计算。插件在受限沙箱中只做确定性计算，不联网。\\n\\nrun_workflow 成功后使用 workflow_result_read 读取完整摘要。摘要包含 summary（stats/nodes/components/commonOpponents）与 fetch-status（实际抓取页数、失败页数、是否完整）。若 failed 大于 0，明确说明数据不完整，不要把局部结果说成完整分析；若 complete 为 false，不要推断缺失对局。分析圈层、枢纽、游离账号和共同对手时，逐条引用具体计数与结构，不编造账号或对局。\\n\\n单个分页失败不会中断其他对手抓取，但会计入 fetch-status.failed；昵称查询失败或关键节点失败会终止流程并如实说明。用户可以调整 pages、opponentCount、maxHops 后重新运行。不要复述原始 JSON，不要声称读到了未包含在摘要中的 edges 明细。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "nickname",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "pages",
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "opponentCount",
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "name": "maxHops",
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 2,
      "enum": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workflow": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "user-url",
        "call": "url.build",
        "args": {
          "base": "https://newframe.foxwq.com/cgi/QueryUserInfoPanel",
          "params": {
            "srcuid": "0",
            "username": "{{input.nickname}}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "user-request",
        "call": "collection.singleton",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "user-url",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "user-fetch",
        "call": "fetch_batch",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "user-request",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "requests"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "user-info-raw",
        "call": "json_extract",
        "args": {
          "path": "$",
          "where": [
            {
              "path": "result",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "path": "uid",
              "op": "ne",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "pick": [
            "uid",
            "username",
            "name",
            "englishname"
          ]
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "user-fetch",
            "path": "[0].value",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "user-info",
        "call": "transform.castFields",
        "args": {
          "fields": {
            "uid": "string"
          }
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "user-info-raw",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "root-seed",
        "call": "collection.singleton",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "user-info",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "root-pages",
        "forEach": {
          "from": "root-seed",
          "path": "$",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "root-paginate",
              "repeat": {
                "maxIterations": "{{input.pages}}",
                "initialState": {
                  "uid": "{{item.uid}}",
                  "cursor": "0"
                },
                "stateFrom": {
                  "from": "page-cursor",
                  "path": "state"
                },
                "until": {
                  "from": "page-cursor",
                  "path": "done"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "id": "page-url",
                    "call": "url.build",
                    "args": {
                      "base": "https://h5.foxwq.com/yehuDiamond/chessbook_local/YHWQFetchChessList",
                      "params": {
                        "srcuid": "0",
                        "dstuid": "{{state.uid}}",
                        "type": "1",
                        "lastcode": "{{state.cursor}}",
                        "searchkey": "",
                        "uin": "{{state.uid}}"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-request",
                    "call": "collection.singleton",
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-url",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-fetch",
                    "call": "fetch_batch",
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-request",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "requests"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-json",
                    "call": "json_extract",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "$",
                      "pick": [
                        "result",
                        "lastcode",
                        "chesslist"
                      ]
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-fetch",
                        "path": "[0].value",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-cursor",
                    "call": "pagination.cursor",
                    "args": {
                      "cursorPath": "lastcode",
                      "itemsPath": "chesslist",
                      "statusPath": "result",
                      "successValue": 0
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-json",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "response"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "root-games-raw",
        "call": "json_extract",
        "args": {
          "path": "[*].items[*].items[*]"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-pages",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "root-games",
        "call": "collection.asArray",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-games-raw",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "opponents",
        "call": "circle.pickOpponents",
        "args": {
          "opponentCount": "{{input.opponentCount}}",
          "maxHops": "{{input.maxHops}}"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-games",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "games"
          },
          {
            "from": "user-info",
            "path": "uid",
            "as": "rootUid"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "opponent-pages",
        "forEach": {
          "from": "opponents",
          "path": "$",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "opponent-paginate",
              "repeat": {
                "maxIterations": "{{input.pages}}",
                "initialState": {
                  "uid": "{{item}}",
                  "cursor": "0"
                },
                "stateFrom": {
                  "from": "page-cursor",
                  "path": "state"
                },
                "until": {
                  "from": "page-cursor",
                  "path": "done"
                },
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "id": "page-url",
                    "call": "url.build",
                    "args": {
                      "base": "https://h5.foxwq.com/yehuDiamond/chessbook_local/YHWQFetchChessList",
                      "params": {
                        "srcuid": "0",
                        "dstuid": "{{state.uid}}",
                        "type": "1",
                        "lastcode": "{{state.cursor}}",
                        "searchkey": "",
                        "uin": "{{state.uid}}"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-request",
                    "call": "collection.singleton",
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-url",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-fetch",
                    "call": "fetch_batch",
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-request",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "requests"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-json",
                    "call": "json_extract",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "$",
                      "pick": [
                        "result",
                        "lastcode",
                        "chesslist"
                      ]
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-fetch",
                        "path": "[0].value",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "page-cursor",
                    "call": "pagination.cursor",
                    "args": {
                      "cursorPath": "lastcode",
                      "itemsPath": "chesslist",
                      "statusPath": "result",
                      "successValue": 0
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "page-json",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "response"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "opponent-games-raw",
        "call": "json_extract",
        "args": {
          "path": "[*].items[*].items[*]"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "opponent-pages",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "opponent-games",
        "call": "collection.asArray",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "opponent-games-raw",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "root-status-raw",
        "call": "json_extract",
        "args": {
          "path": "[*].items[*].ok"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-pages",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "root-status",
        "call": "collection.asArray",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-status-raw",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "opponent-status-raw",
        "call": "json_extract",
        "args": {
          "path": "[*].items[*].ok"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "opponent-pages",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "opponent-status",
        "call": "collection.asArray",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "opponent-status-raw",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "all-status",
        "call": "collection.join",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-status",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "left"
          },
          {
            "from": "opponent-status",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "right"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "fetch-status",
        "call": "collection.statusSummary",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "all-status",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "statuses"
          }
        ],
        "yield": true
      },
      {
        "id": "all-games",
        "call": "collection.join",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "root-games",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "left"
          },
          {
            "from": "opponent-games",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "right"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "unique-games",
        "call": "collection.uniqueBy",
        "args": {
          "key": "chessid"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "all-games",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "items"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "normalize",
        "call": "circle.normalize",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "unique-games",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "games"
          },
          {
            "from": "user-info",
            "path": "uid",
            "as": "rootUid"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "summary",
        "call": "circle.summary",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "normalize",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "analysis"
          }
        ],
        "yield": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "llmProjection": {
    "keep": [
      "summary",
      "fetch-status"
    ]
  },
  "returnToLLM": true
}
